# OpenAPI and clients

- Document: `src/openapi/subscription-service.openapi.ts`. Swagger at `/api-docs` in development only.
- Every endpoint updates paths, `operationId`, tags, and envelope schemas (`success`, `code`, `message`, `data`).
- Express paths stay unversioned (`/subscriptions`). APIM may add `/api/v1`.
- Clients: `src/clients/*.client.ts` with `fetch` + `config.*_BASE_URL`. Not from repositories or controllers.
